::: eye | How the examiner uses this topic
Look at the command words: "**critically** review" (2016), "**critically** analyse" (2019, 2021, 2025, 2026), "give a **critical** gender analysis" (2024), "**critically** evaluate" (2025). The examiner does not want description alone. For every theory and approach, learn (1) what it says, (2) what it says or assumes about women, (3) its **gender critique**, and (4) a **Pakistani example**.
:::
